feat(voronoi-topology): add cell volume, sphericity, face analysis

New Voronoi topology descriptors:
- voronoi_cell_volume(): per-atom Voronoi cell volumes
- voronoi_sphericity(): isoperimetric quotient IQ = 36piV^2/A^3
- voronoi_face_analysis(): per-face statistics (count, areas, perimeters)

C++ changes: store face areas and total surface area from voro++
(previously computed but discarded after weight calculation).

14 tests, example notebook 20_voronoi_topology.ipynb
